{"speciesId":785,"names":{"fr":"Tokorico","es":"Tapu Koko","en":"Tapu Koko","ja":"カプ・コケコ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Gardien de Mele-Mele, il est curieux de tout. Il a le pouvoir d’appeler les nuages orageux pour stocker la foudre dans son corps."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"El espíritu guardián de Melemele, curioso e inquisitivo. Invoca nubes de tormenta y acumula el poder de los rayos en su cuerpo."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"This guardian deity of Melemele is brimming with curiosity. It summons thunderclouds and stores their lightning inside its body."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"好奇心旺盛な メレメレの 守り神。 雷雲を 呼び 雷を 身体に 溜め込む。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Il déstabilise ses ennemis avec sa vitesse ébouriffante. Il pique souvent des colères noires, mais il en oublie aussitôt la raison."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Su endiablada velocidad aturde por completo al enemigo. Pese a su extrema irascibilidad, olvida rápidamente el motivo de su enfado."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"It confuses its enemies by flying too quickly for the eye to follow. It has a hair-trigger temper but forgets what made it angry an instant later."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"目にも 止まらぬ スピードで 敵を かく乱する。 ひどく 怒りっぽいが なんで 怒ったかは すぐ 忘れる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Bien qu’on le considère comme une divinité protectrice, il peut se montrer cruel envers les humains et les Pokémon qui l’ont offensé."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Aunque se le considera un espíritu guardián, obra también como espíritu vengativo contra las personas y Pokémon que desatan su ira."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Although it’s called a guardian deity, if a person or Pokémon puts it in a bad mood, it will become a malevolent deity and attack."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"守り神と 呼ばれるが 気分を 害する 人間や ポケモンには 襲い掛かる 荒ぶる神 でもある。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Il est le gardien de Mele-Mele et le maître de la foudre. D’un naturel curieux, il apparaît devant les humains de temps à autre."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"El espíritu guardián de Melemele, capaz de blandir el rayo. Su eterna curiosidad le lleva a veces a mostrarse ante las personas."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"The lightning-wielding guardian deity of Melemele, Tapu Koko is brimming with curiosity and appears before people from time to time."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"雷を 操る メレメレの 守り神。 好奇心旺盛で 時折 人前に 現れる。"}],"varieties":[{"id":785,"moves":[{"name":"thunder-punch","learns":[[18,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"fly","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"roar","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0]]},{"name":"hyper-beam","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"thunder-shock","learns":[[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"thunderbolt","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"thunder-wave","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"thunder","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"toxic","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0]]},{"name":"agility","learns":[[17,"level-up",53],[18,"level-up",53],[20,"level-up",35],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"quick-attack","learns":[[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"screech","learns":[[17,"level-up",20],[18,"level-up",20],[20,"level-up",40],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"double-team","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0]]},{"name":"withdraw","learns":[[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",5]]},{"name":"light-screen","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"reflect","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"mirror-move","learns":[[17,"level-u